Hi Baloo users. I've been developing a few tools to get more out of Baloo, and I’ve built in Python a search engine to replace baloosearch, a KRunner plugin, and an image viewer. Since the search tool is now mature enough for release, I’ve uploaded it to GitHub. I’ve named this suite Bagheera (the reason should be obvious), and I plan to publish the image viewer in the future followed eventually by the runner. BagheeraSearch introduces several features not currently available in Baloo, such as perform a second search on top of the initial results (which are folder-based), basic natural language support for modified files and the ability to exclude results using != and NOT operators. If anyone is interested in testing it Bagheera is available at: https://github.com/serantes/Bagheera.
